<div id="S1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Our contributions are threefold:</p>
</div>
<div id="S1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S1.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:2em;">
<li id="S1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show that even minor demographic perturbations in personas can lead to meaningful divergences in reasoning outputs (§<a href="#S2" title="2 Uncovering Complementary Knowledge in Counterfactual Personas ‣ CHOIR: Collaborative Harmonization fOr Inference Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We propose <span id="S1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CHOIR</span>, a test-time decoding framework that dynamically harmonizes these diverse reasoning paths to improve both robustness and accuracy (§<a href="#S3" title="3 CHOIR: Collaborative Harmonization fOr Inference Robustness ‣ CHOIR: Collaborative Harmonization fOr Inference Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Through extensive experiments, we show that CHOIR consistently outperforms strong baselines and its performance advantage grows as model scale increases (§<a href="#S5" title="5 Experiments ‣ CHOIR: Collaborative Harmonization fOr Inference Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<figure id="S1.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S1.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:341.6pt;height:61.9pt;vertical-align:-29.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-119.0pt,21.6pt) scale(0.589299573980959,0.589299573980959) ;">
