<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span><span id="A4.T12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quantitative comparison of accuracy and inference latency on GSM8K (Llama-8B).</span> The results highlight two key points: (1) CHOIR achieves a significant accuracy boost over single-path methods for a predictable increase in cost, and (2) it is more accurate than the Persona<sub id="A4.T12.6" class="ltx_sub">majority</sub> baseline at the same level of computational overhead.</figcaption>
